#### Why install a feed reader?

The main advantage a feed reader offers is simplicity: you only get the news from sources you selected and nothing else. There are no ads or recommended articles, it's just pure, distilled
news content for you to read in the order it was published. You have complete control on what you want to add to a feed reader. A feed reader also has a definitive end, there is no endless scrolling. Privacy is also improved
when you don't have to log onto a news website on a browser just to read the latest news. 

